00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:06.160
team land their first production PR a week and a half ago.

189
00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.360
It was pretty exciting.

190
00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:11.280
And then and this is the one for me, that's just kind of like a more fun way

