this really fun about, like a well crafted module, a well crafted function.

194
00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:24.160
We all are guilty of it.

195
00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:26.400
But for me it's like the architecture.

196
00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:27.840
It's the system design.

197
00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:31.360
It is like, how will this thing scale over time?

198
00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:33.480
And that's what I'm going to show in a minute.

