00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:36.400
I think all of that still exists in the world of factory building.

200
00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:39.320
And in fact, you spend almost all of your time doing that work.

201
00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:42.360
So I think even if everything I said

